{"id":"para","lemma":"para","pos":"prep","rank":20,"glosses":["for, to (expressing a recipient)","to, in order to, so, for (expressing the intended purpose of an action)","by, due, due on, due by (expressing a deadline)"],"ipa":"/paɾa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-para.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mira para otro lado.","en":"Look away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439123"},{"text":"Mire para otro lado.","en":"Look away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439124"},{"text":"Miren para otro lado.","en":"Look away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439125"},{"text":"Esto es para usted.","en":"It's for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/191593"},{"text":"¿Para quién es eso?","en":"Who's that for?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604989"}]}